---
import Layout from '../../../components/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import AdSlot from '../../../components/AdSlot.astro';
import { tarotCardsEn } from '../../../data/tarotCardsEn';
import { cardImageSrc } from '../../../data/tarotImages';
import { DEFAULT_LASTMOD, getSiteUrl } from '../../../data/site';

const breadcrumbs = [{ name: 'TarotMind', path: '/en/' }, { name: 'Tarot Card Meanings', path: '/en/cards/' }];
const major = tarotCardsEn.filter((card) => card.arcana === 'major');
const minor = tarotCardsEn.filter((card) => card.arcana === 'minor');
const siteUrl = getSiteUrl();
const jsonLd = [{
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'ItemList',
  name: 'Tarot card meanings',
  numberOfItems: tarotCardsEn.length,
  itemListElement: tarotCardsEn.map((card, index) => ({
    '@type': 'ListItem',
    position: index + 1,
    name: card.nameEn,
    url: `${siteUrl}/en/cards/${card.id}/`
  }))
}];
---
<Layout
  locale="en"
  title="Tarot Card Meanings | 78 Upright and Reversed Cards"
  description="Explore all 78 tarot card meanings with upright, reversed, love, career, and money interpretations."
  canonicalPath="/en/cards/"
  pageType="CollectionPage"
  keywords={['tarot card meanings', 'major arcana meanings', 'minor arcana meanings', 'upright tarot', 'reversed tarot']}
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
  datePublished={DEFAULT_LASTMOD}
  dateModified={DEFAULT_LASTMOD}
>
  <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} ariaLabel="Breadcrumb" />
  <section class="page-hero container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Card meanings</span>
    <h1>Tarot card meanings for all 78 cards</h1>
    <p>Explore Major and Minor Arcana keywords, upright meanings, reversed meanings, love, career, money, and practical advice.</p>
  </section>
  <article class="container readable-content">
    <AdSlot placement="card-index-primary" locale="en" />
    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>22 Major Arcana Cards</h2>
      <p>The Major Arcana cards describe major themes, turning points, lessons, and transitions. When a Major card appears, it can point to a larger pattern behind the question.</p>
      <div class="meaning-grid">
        {major.map((card) => (
          <article class="meaning-card">
            <a class="meaning-card-image-link" href={`/en/cards/${card.id}/`} aria-label={`Read the meaning of ${card.nameEn}`}>
              <img class="meaning-card-image" src={cardImageSrc(card)} alt={`${card.nameEn} tarot card image`} width="500" height="866" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
            </a>
            <div>
              <span class="card-number">{card.number}</span>
              <h3>{card.nameEn}</h3>
              <p>{card.keywords.join(' · ')}</p>
              <small>{card.upright.general}</small>
              <a class="text-link" href={`/en/cards/${card.id}/`}>Read {card.nameEn} meaning -></a>
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>56 Minor Arcana Cards</h2>
      <p>The Minor Arcana cards describe daily emotions, choices, actions, thoughts, work, money, and practical details through Wands, Cups, Swords, and Pentacles.</p>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Card</th><th>Suit</th><th>Keywords</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {minor.map((card) => (
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a class="minor-card-link" href={`/en/cards/${card.id}/`}>
                    <img class="minor-card-image" src={cardImageSrc(card)} alt={`${card.nameEn} tarot card image`} width="500" height="866" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                    <span>{card.nameEn}</span>
                  </a>
                </td>
                <td>{card.suit ? card.suit[0].toUpperCase() + card.suit.slice(1) : 'Minor Arcana'}</td>
                <td>{card.keywords.join(', ')}</td>
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="content-section warning-box">
      <h2>Read Card Meanings by Context</h2>
      <p>A card meaning changes with the question, position, surrounding cards, and real situation. Do not use one card alone to make an important decision.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
